# AI coding harnesses offered in the Install menu: the name mise knows each by, then what to call it.
# Only names that mise's registry still lists are shown, so a removed tool disappears by itself.
# Anything else mise can install is under "More tools" in the same menu.
claude	Claude Code
codex	Codex
opencode	opencode
antigravity-cli	Antigravity CLI
gemini	Gemini CLI
copilot	GitHub Copilot CLI
cursor-agent	Cursor Agent
amp	Amp
crush	Crush
goose-agent	Goose
qwen	Qwen Code
pi	Pi
